{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>Or crookbacked.</b> A hunchback — the language of hilly terrain — a man who is stout and tall and too heavy to perform the sacred service. Or short of stature." "<b>Or a dwar.</b> The language of corruption, as in 'עשו תבל'." "<b>Or with a blemish.</b> The language of crushing, as in 'וימרחו על השחין'."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:14:09.636198888Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}